 "call2": "{\"other\": \"letter\", \"title\": \"Informational Letter\", \"subject\": \"Informationen zu unserem neuen Kundenportal\", \"summary\": \"Dear Herr Mustermann, we are pleased to inform you that your bank will be offering a new customer portal starting November 1, 2026. You will find your account details, documents, and messages on this portal. No changes will affect your existing accounts, cards, or login credentials. Please visit our website or your branch for more details.\", \"qs\": [\"What is the purpose of the letter?\", \"How can I access the new portal?\", \"Will my existing account details remain unchanged?\"]}",
